 "description": "The Juniper Networks NetScreen-5000 Series is a line of purpose built, high-performance security systems designed to deliver a new level of high-performance capabilities for large enterprise, carrier, and data center networks. The NetScreen-5000 Series consists of two products, the 2-slot NetScreen-5200 and the 4-slot NetScreen-5400. The NetScreen-5000 Series security systems integrate firewall, DoS and DDoS protection, VPN, and traffic management functionality in low-profile modular chassis.",
